; 38R2, the bones table. prp_table_large has NO node scale and root_scale 1.0, so 2.848 x 0.813 x
; 1.097 is the real size — the number town_hub records for Bryn's order bench and embermarket for
; Nessa's assay counter, reused rather than re-derived (38P2's trap is a measured box that never had
; its transforms applied).
