; GROUND COVER (38B) - a thin band hard against the boundary and NOTHING in the middle.
;
; Style "edges", scattered by tools/dress_cell.py (seed 38), which reads this cell's OWN node
; positions out of this file and treats them as keep-outs, so nothing lands inside a building or on
; a merchant. Regenerate with:
;     python tools/dress_cell.py scenes/regions/ember_crown/hollowreach.tscn edges 35
;
; WARNING EVERY NODE BELOW PARENTS TO THE CELL ROOT, NOT TO Nav, AND CARRIES NO COLLIDER. The navmesh
; parses static colliders only, so a collider-less tuft could not carve it from inside Nav either -
; but parenting out states the intent where a reader will see it. Grass an NPC paths around is worse
; than no grass.
;
; WARNING SCALE LIVES IN THE .import. The nature megakit ships its trees at 1 m = 1 unit and its
; ground cover four to ten times life size. Correct a size in the prop's .import so every cell gets
; it, never in a transform here. docs/ASSET_POLICY.md section 0.3.
; ====================================================================================================


[node name="MapPin" type="Node3D" parent="."]
position = Vector3(-21, 0, 2)
script = ExtResource("maploc_39_5a")
LocationId = "location.hollowreach.reach"

[node name="MapPin" type="Node3D" parent="ReachWaystone"]
